	(text "U8 (+2V5) ECP5 VCCAUX. Ilk guc agacinda ATLANMISTI — FPGA'yi hic\ncalistirmayan turden bir eksik. ADP150AUJZ-2.5, LCSC C144257."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0890664a-69fd-4f31-9287-323d976d7bbc")
	)
	(text "FPGA CEKIRDEK +1V1 — TPS62130 #2"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0b852272-c455-44ff-b011-5d2ce6931b93")
	)
	(text "U9 (+1V8_CLK) ADCLK846'nin VS rayi. Veri sayfasi basligi:\n'1.8 V, 6 LVDS/12 CMOS Output Clock Fanout Buffer'. Saat bolumu\nbastan 3.3 V varsayilmisti — tampon o rayda calismaz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "103c7455-723e-4099-8f8d-9d500b38e18e")
	)
	(text "DAC AVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 312 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "171c9aa6-c055-4c9c-9afd-c9dab9f49b9c")
	)
	(text "GUC BUTCESI ~2.8 W -> 12V'ta ~230 mA. 10 Ah aku ile ~40 saat.\nSaha modunda ikinci PHY yazilimdan kapatilabilir, 0.25 W kazanc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 268 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1d13b203-b298-490a-b0fd-4f88b67a9686")
	)
	(text "+1V8\nFPGA VCCIO\nbanka 6/3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 219 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20c1e2ca-ded6-4d3f-b807-0496e00d8bf4")
	)
	(text "GIRIS VE KORUMA — NETLIST.md §9\n9-18 V aku ya da tezgah kaynagi. Ters polarite sahada bir kere olur, yeter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3543b781-07b7-456e-be21-3ebc96060eef")
	)
	(text "ADC DRVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 202 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "35f0f852-7c3c-4177-8db2-58109f117d5b")
	)
	(text "HASSAS RAYLAR — her biri AYRI LDO, AYRI ADA. Anahtarlamalidan BESLENMEZ (§1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "39a5ed81-3c15-4761-a187-cc99cb966e37")
	)
	(text "ANA RAY +3V3 — TPS62130, 3-17V giris, 3A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3eccb922-7dbb-4294-8342-b3cc7dcbaba7")
	)
	(text "FPGA VCCAUX\nZORUNLU"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "40d0a9ab-868f-4329-8bfc-70a8c9cd9525")
	)
	(text "U6 (+3V3_CLK) VCXO'nun TEK beslemesi. Ferrit boncuk, ayri toprak adasi.\nBesleme gurultusu DOGRUDAN faz gurultusune donusuyor — manset spec burada."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "460435ce-c64f-4a57-b253-2375444b56ea")
	)
	(text "ADC AVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5cc3c142-ff39-4294-94c1-39453536a13c")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG sadece VIN_PROT'ta: o ray konnektorden geliyor, gercek guc\ncikisi pini yok. Regulator ciktilarina bayrak konursa ERC cakisma verir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130 62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "715d53c8-60e9-4bb9-9cbe-57e582339d8d")
	)
	(text "AYRISTIRMA (NETLIST.md §1)\nher ECP5 VCC/VCCIO topu 100nF, viasi dogrudan duzleme · ECP5 toplu 4x10uF + 2x47uF\nADC AVDD x8 pin basina 100nF + toplu 10uF · ADC DRVDD x4 100nF\nVCXO 100nF + 10uF + FERRIT BONCUK · PHY 10uF X5R  (Y5V KULLANMA, datasheet s.46-53)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "71a0cec8-50e2-4895-9b79-cc5f674fd7db")
	)
	(text "1.1V icin oran 0.375.  EN zinciri: U1 PG -> U2 EN,\nguc siralamasi VCC(1.1) once, sonra VCCAUX, sonra VCCIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 237 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9919c364-a0ad-4e50-b2b2-704e7e6e59f1")
	)
	(text "Vout = 0.8 x (1 + R3/R4).  3.3V icin oran 3.125\nL1 ve Cout datasheet Tablo 8'den."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 37 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9c4dc52c-c905-42b3-84c3-9f406182e65f")
	)
	(text "Q1 kaynagi girise, drain VIN_PROT'a. Govde diyodu ters baglamada iletmiyor.\nR1 gate'i asagi ceker (P-kanal icin iletim), D2 Vgs'i 12V'ta sinirlar.\nTVS ve sigorta drain tarafinda — koruma yukun oncesinde."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c6ddf572-330b-4437-b5a0-9834c4d6b1cf")
	)
